        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The diagrams give information about changes in a student accommodation. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The diagrams give information about changes in a student accommodation. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task&nbsp; 1 - Changes in Student Accommodation</em></p>\n<p><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vCxOt5t1tcA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Changes in Student Accommodation y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục của khu k&yacute; t&uacute;c x&aacute; sinh vi&ecirc;n, so s&aacute;nh bố cục của n&oacute; v&agrave;o năm 2010 với c&aacute;ch sắp xếp hiện tại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Changes in Student Accommodation với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: khu k&yacute; t&uacute;c x&aacute; sinh vi&ecirc;n - bố cục v&agrave;o năm 2010 - c&aacute;ch sắp xếp hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CdvqdqsCwoZpISxeqMFlbClCg8d\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UCESd0vGuoaMvWxsRUplvXFFgSe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>đ&atilde; c&oacute; những thay đổi đ&aacute;ng kể ở khu vực b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i, với phần lớn khu vườn ph&iacute;a nam bị thay thế bằng b&atilde;i đỗ xe, trong khi một cụm vườn ở ph&iacute;a bắc đ&atilde; được di dời.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ov5fdY0sQoCUNcxtz5vlLEx4ghe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>b&ecirc;n trong, thay đổi quan trọng nhất l&agrave; việc tăng <em>số lượng ph&ograve;ng ngủ (bedroom facility)</em> từ ba l&ecirc;n năm ph&ograve;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MOTMdZC0HouEOQx8MhUlX7Drg5c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Khu vực b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PBckdltqRo7DJJxGPfDlTnnhgVf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A98zdjwIlosFoDxzhlllNu6bgTd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) sự thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; nhất l&agrave; việc thay thế <strong>khu vườn ph&iacute;a nam (the southern garden)</strong> bằng <strong>một b&atilde;i đỗ xe (a car parking facility).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8V6di1s5oIvpNx2wqslaehZgBe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) một số <strong>kh&ocirc;ng gian vườn (garden spaces)</strong> vẫn được giữ lại <em>dọc theo chu vi ph&iacute;a bắc (along the northern perimeter)</em>, một cụm vườn đ&atilde; <em>được di chuyển đến một vị tr&iacute; kh&aacute;c (be moved to a different position)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Si9zdJ01CoXNpKxbpDplBydJgfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>lối v&agrave;o ch&iacute;nh (the main entrance)</strong> vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu ở ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i của t&ograve;a nh&agrave;.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Khu vực b&ecirc;n trong</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA1tdIxp8oyFmxxuczlldPANgub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FXSPd3uRBonve1xC3UwlOdGPg4f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) thay đổi lớn nhất l&agrave; việc chuyển đổi <strong>ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch (living room)</strong> th&agrave;nh <strong>hai ph&ograve;ng ngủ cho sinh vi&ecirc;n (two student bedrooms)</strong>, tăng tổng số ph&ograve;ng từ ba l&ecirc;n năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xv32dFnY5oOGAyxwO3ilk39ngCd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) Một ph&ograve;ng c&oacute; <strong>ph&ograve;ng tắm ri&ecirc;ng (an en-suite room)</strong> cũng đ&atilde; được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o <strong>khu vực h&agrave;nh lang (hallway area)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PdjPd4LStopoy3xilghlizplgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 3) <strong>nh&agrave; bếp (kitchen)</strong> vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; <em>ở phần ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n phải của t&ograve;a nh&agrave; (in the right section of the building)</em>, v&agrave; <strong>ph&ograve;ng tắm (bathroom)</strong> vẫn nằm <em>liền kề with (adjacent with)</em> h&agrave;nh lang, cả hai đều <em>giữ nguy&ecirc;n k&iacute;ch thước v&agrave; vị tr&iacute; ban đầu (keep their original sizes and locations)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1644,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KGTXd3M3OoUznZxnm8xl0jg1geX\">The two diagrams illustrate the modifications made to a student accommodation, comparing its layout in 2010 with the current arrangement.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18141,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1645,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EcC1dFp0KoZKq9xOLhrlTLY6gid\">Overall, substantial changes have occurred to the exterior, with most of the southern garden area being replaced by a car parking facility, while a cluster of gardens in the north has been relocated. Internally, the most significant modification is the increase in bedroom capacity from three to five units.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18141,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1646,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KHQhdZbeOovOJQxUPP7lY2jJgHf\">Looking at the exterior changes, the most notable transformation is the replacement of the southern garden area with a car parking facility. Additionally, while some garden spaces have been preserved along the northern perimeter, one cluster has been moved to a different position. The main entrance, however, maintains its original location on the left side of the building.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18141,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1647,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L4OAdMuD4o8wFqx600vlDYuVg6c\">Regarding the interior layout, the most substantial change is the conversion of the living room into two student bedrooms, increasing the total number from three to five. An en-suite room has also been added to the hallway area. Meanwhile, the kitchen retains its position in the right section of the building, and the bathroom remains adjacent to the hallway, both keeping their original sizes and locations.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18141,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
